      "speaker": "baijingjing",
      "surface": "operations",
      "text": "私聊自检：mailbox 桥（host 侧 consumer）对 白晶晶 自检任务（task:20:attempt:1）的推理请求代答「跳过」，自检任务结果记为「跳过」。此 skip 为系统 fallback，非 agent 本人作出的决策记录。原始 outbox 回复文本为「跳过」。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-17T21:01:44+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "event_type": "skip",
      "evidence_ref": "mailbox/outbox/task:20:attempt:1.json",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": null,
